      "Grapevine 3.01's own `VariousClass` (GV-SOURCEMAP.md): the generic character class for a creature type Grapevine has no dedicated support for. Owner ruling: Various is the Storyteller-only creature type - unpriced (no `creation_rules` document, so the build tally reads zero), offered to a Storyteller in every chronicle and never to a player, and able to hold any block from any creature type, or a custom entry, so a Storyteller can build whatever the story needs. Its sheet lists the merged Abilities, Backgrounds, Merits, Flaws and Tempers (tools/catalog/build_various.py), Derangements, the Storyteller's own Other Powers, and every creature type's base power family."
